---
import photoSrc from "../assets/hugo-brouzet-stage.jpg?url";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import paucLogoSrc from "../assets/pauc-academie-logo.png";
import { withBase } from "../utils/links";
---

<section class="parrain">
	<div class="wrap">
		<div class="photo">
			<img src={photoSrc} alt="Hugo Brouzet" loading="lazy" />
		</div>
		<div class="content">
			<span class="kicker">Notre parrain</span>
			<h2>Hugo Brouzet</h2>
			<Image src={paucLogoSrc} alt="PAUC Académie" width={100} height={100} format="webp" loading="lazy" class="pauc-logo" />
			<p>
				Hugo Brouzet est le parrain officiel du Handball Islois. Pivot
				professionnel au PAUC (Pays d&rsquo;Aix Université Club Handball), il
				évolue au plus haut niveau, en LNH Division&nbsp;1 / Starligue.
			</p>
			<p>Son soutien est une vraie fierté pour tout le club, des plus jeunes aux seniors.</p>
			<a class="cta" href={withBase("/le-club")}>Découvrir le club →</a>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.parrain {
		background: var(--color-white);
		padding: 3.5rem 1.5rem;
	}
	.wrap {
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: minmax(180px, 260px) 1fr;
		gap: 2.5rem;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.photo {
		aspect-ratio: 4 / 5;
		border-radius: 16px;
		overflow: hidden;
		background: var(--color-navy);
	}
	.photo img {
		width: 100%;
		height: 100%;
		object-fit: cover;
		display: block;
	}
	.kicker {
		display: inline-block;
		color: var(--color-crimson);
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}
	h2 {
		color: var(--color-navy-deep);
		font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 4vw, 2.1rem);
		margin: 0 0 0.9rem;
	}
	.pauc-logo {
		float: right;
		width: 100px;
		height: 100px;
		object-fit: contain;
		margin: 0 0 0.75rem 1rem;
	}
	.content p {
		color: var(--color-navy-deep);
		font-size: 1.02rem;
		line-height: 1.6;
		margin: 0 0 0.85rem;
	}
	.cta {
		display: inline-block;
		margin-top: 0.5rem;
		color: var(--color-blue);
		font-weight: 800;
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 2px solid var(--color-crimson);
		padding-bottom: 0.15rem;
	}
	.cta:hover {
		color: var(--color-crimson);
	}

	@media (max-width: 640px) {
		.wrap {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
			gap: 1.5rem;
			text-align: center;
		}
		.photo {
			max-width: 220px;
			margin: 0 auto;
		}
		.pauc-logo {
			float: none;
			margin: 0 auto 1rem;
		}
		.cta {
			border-bottom: none;
		}
	}
</style>
